==={{BotW|-}}===
Fruits are a type of [[Material]] that can be found throughout [[Hyrule Kingdom]]. [[Acorn]]s and [[Chickaloo Tree Nut]]s do not count as Fruits when [[Cooking]]. All Fruits turn into [[Roasted Food]] when exposed to [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].

Several [[Food]]s require Fruits as [[Ingredient]]s in their [[Recipe]]s. [[Apple Pie]], [[Fried Bananas]], [[Honeyed Apple]], [[Hot Buttered Apple]], [[Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin]], [[Pepper Seafood]], [[Pepper Steak]], [[Pumpkin Pie]], [[Pumpkin Stew]], [[Spicy Sautéed Peppers]], and the [[Wildberry Crepe]] all require a specific Fruit. Recipes that can use any Fruit are the [[Fruit and Mushroom Mix]], [[Honeyed Fruits]], [[Simmered Fruit]], [[Copious Simmered Fruit]], and [[Steamed Fruit]]. Uniquely, [[Fruit Pie]] requires any Fruit that is not an [[Apple]], and [[Fruitcake]] requires either an Apple or a [[Wildberry]] in addition to another Fruit. [[Nutcake]] and [[Sautéed Nuts]] also specifically require an [[Acorn]] or a [[Chickaloo Tree Nut]].

